      "power_level": {
        "combat": 0,
        "social": 0,
        "general": 2
      },
      "desc": "Passive; This character does not need to breathe, eat, or drink; they can survive in vacuum and underwater; is immune to poisons and toxins; and cannot knowingly endanger humans.\nSource: Shadow of the Beanstalk",
