      "power_level": {
        "combat": 2,
        "social": 1,
        "general": 0
      },
      "desc": "Maneuver; Once per encounter, may suffer 3 strain and spend a maneuver to force all other character within long range (or within earshot) to make a Daunting Discipline check as an out-of-turn incidental. If they fail, they must use their maneuver to move farther away; if they fail with ✇, they must also downgrade their action to an additional maneuver to move even farther away. If you're using the fear rules found on page 243 of the Genesys Core Rulebook, this can be a fear check instead.\nSource: Shadow of the Beanstalk",
      "ex": "Nemesis"
    },
